{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S06、S13等段的感受词仍然偏密，部分连续出现时容易分散注意力；X的左右分栏和完整叙述在整体阅读连贯性上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的核心话语用【】突出，观众不必读完每句话就能抓住人物当下的处境和心理转折；感受词按音乐进程出现，也让扫屏更容易与听觉体验同步。更重要的是，Y反复围绕「被当作自己人」「不愿再受气」「带着想念继续生活」展开，使人物从怀念、挣扎到接受现实的变化更具体，音乐感受也比X细腻、有层次。X的完整句子确实更顺畅，但右侧感受词较像并列的信息清单，部分情绪和音乐变化缺少明确的时间对应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e17b088-45ba-43e0-a86f-fb00b13d58f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210613023308Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:07:36.780962+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b99b583433b9f7aa768d945347efb88bf66712c2b63ee91089316093921fe0dd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha